{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4eb47c087ebbd9cf6cb4baea30f352f0f31dcf0334ee54b68812626acd183423", "ja": "（恵美のPV撮影は、実際の校舎を借りて行われた。\n撮影は順調に進み、お昼休憩に入った……）", "zh": "（惠美的PV是在借来的实际校舍里拍摄的。\n拍摄进展顺利，到了午休时间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "47ee6ad9ae4e41592107d429487f8b14143f41d380bc35967bc317420c33b545", "ja": "みんなー、お弁当もらった？\nまだの人は、近くのスタッフさんに言ってねー！", "zh": "大家——领到便当了吗？\n还没拿到的，记得跟身旁的工作人员说一声哦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1002_josikosei", "source_sha256": "be3d0cb6af05ad0fb8f7a6dae94b3bfabfc9eb1bfbaef1ad22017ceee79ea759", "ja": "あの、恵美ちゃん。\n一緒に写真撮ってもいいかな？", "zh": "那个，惠美。\n可以一起拍张照吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "4c0767f6e2775e9fb0cf14a12649c8789c257f1ec98eff4e4647a30018fa09fa", "ja": "いいよいいよ！　全然オッケー♪\nポーズはどうする？　アタシ合わせるよ。", "zh": "好呀好呀！完全没问题♪\n摆什么姿势？我来配合你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1004_josikosei", "source_sha256": "7613b92e264f3ecb80b297038c6d049301bb107b96eea1bec7b155134ddd4d5a", "ja": "ありがとう……！　じゃあ……。", "zh": "谢谢……！那么……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1005_null", "source_sha256": "26bad7a9a0e63c7b8e956ffc3986f65b4a48ad74c64be68c4f7a5220d7922633", "ja": "30分後……", "zh": "30分钟后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1006_020meg", "source_sha256": "8f0c02b664e71c803a457197757811a481ea1ce6c0133401ae0aa5f5d7d2734d", "ja": "{$P$}、やっと見つけたー！\nこんな隅っこにいるとか、わかりにくいよー！", "zh": "{$P$}，终于找到你了——！\n居然待在这种角落里，也太难找了吧——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1007_p", "source_sha256": "563ce0c79787efc007a1874a4d445ac4df1e821bc998e2529db0331e2465c5f7", "ja": "ごめんな。なんていうか……\n独特の空気で、教室には居づらくて。", "zh": "抱歉啊。怎么说呢……\n这里的气氛有点特别，我实在不太好待在教室里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d7eb6568b60a02e5e3656da75a583450d72df5eb2c60ea5af49d5c2746341edd", "ja": "それより、恵美の目的は達成できたのか？\nお昼食べる前に、やることがあるって言ってたけど。", "zh": "话说回来，惠美的目的达成了吗？\n你之前说午饭前还有事情要做来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "f27cd27b95f9932f7839fa38821f3771fc0e2302a4439ec9ca6e2dcb30c86817", "ja": "うん。みんなに、撮影の感想聞いてたんだ。\nみんな、楽しいって言ってくれて、よかったー。", "zh": "嗯。我刚才在问大家对拍摄有什么感想。\n大家都说很开心，太好了——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "0bdcf7fdfe26dde5251da3d68b782ca48f8d7d3672f8b24facba68152791d380", "ja": "あ、それとね。\nこの後のシーンのアイディア、貰っちゃった！", "zh": "啊，还有哦。\n我还得到了后面场景的点子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1011_020meg", "source_sha256": "07344f263c1434b78432030b332f63cf95844deff068cc9841a9d24ce71729d3", "ja": "そうだ！　スタッフさんに相談しようと思ったんだ。\nアタシ、ちょっと行って……。", "zh": "对了！我正想去找工作人员商量来着。\n我先去一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3df1f0517ac36124667f2ed8842a33d823f938272af4220ab819f27c7b83d860", "ja": "ストップ！　相談は、俺が代わりにしてくるよ。\nだから今は、休憩すること！", "zh": "等等！我去替你和工作人员商量吧。\n所以现在先休息！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "af0d7a13f701a08926cd574a31c4dfb3acb980c7c7fc11908776026b664aefef", "ja": "あはは……そうだね。", "zh": "啊哈哈……是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1014_p", "source_sha256": "4fcb1db9958f7c5b4e1b4fbf3cd26f2ad96dda71013e7c1ecf216da419f470ce", "ja": "恵美は、劇場でもよく周りを気遣ってるけど、\n学校や家でも、こんな感じなのか？", "zh": "惠美在剧场里也经常照顾身边的人，\n在学校和家里也是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "15ecbe13a1f9e63851d398e5a272834af55d55ca0ee1180271382af2a8580d06", "ja": "う～ん……考えたことないけど、そうかも。\nなんか、放っておけないんだよね……。", "zh": "嗯……没想过这个问题，不过，可能是吧。\n总觉得，没法放着不管呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1016_020meg", "source_sha256": "710ced0a90bdfc5987cbc19ace2020ae454b1b54c39c9ab6eebff097a709e68e", "ja": "悲しい顔とか見たくないし。せめて、\nアタシといる時は、ハッピーな気持ちでいてほしい。", "zh": "我也不想看到你露出悲伤的表情。至少，\n和我在一起的时候，希望你能开开心心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1017_020meg", "source_sha256": "a464a6a688b5eb0acfd8d4db971388c98f3103507b2ff848481b8c5990c1edd0", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}もだよ。\n困ったことがあったら、アタシに言ってね？", "zh": "当然，{$P$}也是一样哦。\n要是遇到什么难处，记得跟我说哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1018_p", "source_sha256": "abd5418d8955f58f4eb72d90aa53cd06b232b6dbb66ab43b7e1dad2d50b23774", "ja": "ありがとう。\nもう十分、いつも助けてもらってるよ。", "zh": "谢谢。\n已经够多了，你一直都在帮助我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1019_020meg", "source_sha256": "53add06532c6c54b1628f18c9e74033d22c75b6a112c0fbc0930324bb6d0374e", "ja": "えー……そう？\nアタシ的には、全然助けてるカンジしないけど……。", "zh": "诶……是吗？\n可在我看来，完全没有帮上忙的感觉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1020_p", "source_sha256": "7cdb9d84403c6f6007c9aba05b95553bf9edf35565bf3af7bb054ca7374428b0", "ja": "いやいや。実際に今日もそうだろ？　共演の子達が\n撮影を楽しんでるのは、恵美のおかげじゃないか。", "zh": "不不不。今天实际上不也是这样吗？一起出演的孩子们\n能开开心心享受拍摄，可都是多亏了惠美啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1021_020meg", "source_sha256": "6db6c8ef8bde8033d9d074dec41754f4a0137f21a4d1a8f5e5bd7475d41f4f05", "ja": "そ、それはアタシの力だけじゃないっていうか……\nもう～。こういうの、恥ずかしいんだって。", "zh": "这、这也不全是靠我一个人的力量啦……\n真是的～这种话很让人害羞的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1022_020meg", "source_sha256": "633e58e8b9a870f9792e48de5e6f89780162eff1c7a2dca3ad29c8328fa0b322", "ja": "……とにかく！　これからも、どんどん\n{$P$}を助けるから頼りにしてよね！", "zh": "……总之！今后我也会多多\n帮{$P$}的忙，尽管依赖我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1023_p", "source_sha256": "c8f1eb93daf32c37c0d93e191e9dc51816a4b4fc551424fa4c03c13906f9f6b0", "ja": "ああ、わかったよ。", "zh": "嗯，我知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_020meg0544_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_020meg0544_1024_020meg", "source_sha256": "ff57567f4b53cab520e7c7051cee63919cbd810a684bd7ad5f04dc2589fed43a", "ja": "ホントだよ？　悩んだ時は、ちゃーんと頼ること！\nアタシとの約束、ね♪", "zh": "真的哦？有烦恼的时候，要好好依靠我！\n这是和我的约定哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
